  "transcript": "A top AI model's edge is not just its weights, it is the hidden system prompt that tells it how to plan, when to use tools, and how to format the answer. In this short you will see how to write your own Claude-grade system prompt (role, tool-use rules, planning steps, guardrails, output format, examples) and paste it into cheaper open models like GLM 5.2 from Zhipu and Kimi K2.7 from Moonshot so they follow a strong playbook. This teaches prompt engineering, it does not redistribute any leaked proprietary prompt.\n\n#Shorts #AI #promptengineering\n\nGet the blueprint here: https://docs.google.com/document/d/1Iss1Q2ODRHE3nSNoKYgu0dMdmmQYU0VOc9Ba29byilY/edit?usp=sharing",
